# Core design only; source identities and proof receipts remain in Org.
title: WEAVER / PUBLISHED CHECKPOINT / SAFE WAL TRUNCATION {
  class: title
  near: top-center
}
protocols: GO / RECOVERY OBSERVATIONS {
  top: 0
  left: 0
  width: 350
  height: 690
  label.near: top-center
  style.font-size: 17
  style.fill: "#f7faf9"
  style.stroke: "#9bb6ad"
  mcp: Publication timeout and readback\nResolve the original checkpoint body\nNo deletion from an assumed success {
    top: 90
    left: 20
    width: 310
    height: 120
    label.near: center-center
    class: cloud
  }
  a2a: Snapshot and prefix observations\nOriginal claim and reservation binding\nUnknown usage keeps its hold {
    top: 295
    left: 20
    width: 310
    height: 120
    label.near: center-center
    class: cloud
  }
  acp: Cloud native owner recovery\nOld descriptors grant no authority\nNo floor reset from local snapshots {
    top: 500
    left: 20
    width: 310
    height: 120
    label.near: center-center
    class: cloud
  }
  goBrand: "" {
    shape: image
    icon: ../../architecture/diagrams/assets/go.svg
    top: 247
    left: 24
    width: 42
    height: 22
  }
  kubernetesBrand: "" {
    shape: image
    icon: ../../architecture/diagrams/assets/kubernetes.svg
    top: 247
    left: 82
    width: 28
    height: 28
  }
}
registry: SCHEME / COMPLETE SNAPSHOT CONTRACT {
  top: 0
  left: 440
  width: 350
  height: 690
  label.near: top-center
  style.font-size: 17
  style.fill: "#f8fafb"
  style.stroke: "#9bb6ad"
  origin: Complete original account image\nApplications / reservations / holds\nBalances / source and profile bindings {
    top: 90
    left: 20
    width: 310
    height: 120
    label.near: center-center
    class: semantic
  }
  alias: Cedar Code as Policy at each gate\nPublish / truncate / activate\nCurrent parent / floor / owner / prefix {
    top: 295
    left: 20
    width: 310
    height: 120
    label.near: center-center
    class: policy
  }
  query: Checkpoint and committed suffix\nReconstruct the current account head\nUncommitted tail remains pending {
    top: 500
    left: 20
    width: 310
    height: 120
    label.near: center-center
    class: runtime
  }
}
recovery: RUST / CAPTURE AND PUBLICATION {
  top: 0
  left: 880
  width: 350
  height: 690
  label.near: top-center
  style.font-size: 17
  style.fill: "#f7faf9"
  style.stroke: "#9bb6ad"
  projection: Capture an authenticated prefix\nComplete account state and namespace\nNo missing-key reset or balance delta {
    top: 90
    left: 20
    width: 310
    height: 120
    label.near: center-center
    class: semantic
  }
  join: Retain a durable immutable body\nRetrieve exact content before deletion\nDigest alone is not a recovery copy {
    top: 295
    left: 20
    width: 310
    height: 120
    label.near: center-center
    class: runtime
  }
  fence: Protected publication parent CAS\nExact checkpoint ID and body\nRecovery floor never rolls back {
    top: 500
    left: 20
    width: 310
    height: 120
    label.near: center-center
    class: policy
  }
}
broker: RUST / TRUNCATION AND RECOVERY {
  top: 0
  left: 1320
  width: 350
  height: 690
  label.near: top-center
  style.font-size: 17
  style.fill: "#f8fafb"
  style.stroke: "#9bb6ad"
  cas: Read current publication and body\nExact selection and generation\nCurrent owner and source stamps {
    top: 90
    left: 20
    width: 310
    height: 120
    label.near: center-center
    class: runtime
  }
  alias: Delete only the covered local prefix\nPreserve later frames and candidates\nNo application or reservation reset {
    top: 295
    left: 20
    width: 310
    height: 120
    label.near: center-center
    class: policy
  }
  hold: Recover checkpoint and suffix\nCurrent floor / financial head / owner\nMissing evidence keeps recovery closed {
    top: 500
    left: 20
    width: 310
    height: 120
    label.near: center-center
    class: semantic
  }
  rustBrand: "" {
    shape: image
    icon: ../../architecture/diagrams/assets/rust.svg
    top: 40
    left: 156
    width: 34
    height: 34
  }
}
quint: QUINT\nMissing IDs / reservations / holds / suffix records\nLost publication replies / rollback / old workers {
  top: 810
  left: 220
  width: 610
  height: 100
  class: policy
}
lean: LEAN\nActual WAL / account / source composition\nReplay equivalence / monotonic floor / unique IDs {
  top: 810
  left: 960
  width: 610
  height: 100
  class: semantic
}
protocols.mcp -> registry.origin
protocols.a2a -> registry.alias
protocols.acp -> registry.query
registry.origin -> recovery.projection
registry.alias -> recovery.join
registry.query -> recovery.fence { style.stroke-dash: 4 }
recovery.projection -> recovery.join
recovery.join -> recovery.fence
recovery.fence -> broker.cas
broker.cas -> broker.alias
broker.alias -> broker.hold
broker.hold -> broker.cas: Refresh the current publication { style.stroke-dash: 4 }

